WEBVTT

00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:25.000
Please... Hurry up and surrender!

00:00:27.330 --> 00:00:29.170
Surrender...

00:00:41.970 --> 00:00:43.430
I...

00:00:43.430 --> 00:00:45.060
Well done, Mirim.

00:00:46.150 --> 00:00:49.110
As long as you're around, the Queen's army is invincible.

00:00:49.110 --> 00:00:52.400
With you and your hyper-vibration armour at the forefront,

00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:54.700
we'll soon be praised by all.

00:00:55.820 --> 00:00:57.110
By all?

00:00:57.910 --> 00:01:00.370
Now let's keep this up.

00:01:03.700 --> 00:01:04.910
Right!

00:02:45.810 --> 00:02:47.890
Praised by all...

00:02:50.560 --> 00:02:53.810
Mirim-sama, let us wash your back!

00:02:54.520 --> 00:02:56.650
We'll give you a massage, too!

00:02:56.650 --> 00:03:01.070
Oh, uh, I'm fine. I can do it myself.

00:03:02.030 --> 00:03:03.570
Um!

00:03:03.570 --> 00:03:05.910
It'll be fine.

00:03:05.910 --> 00:03:07.740
That's not fair! I want in, too!

00:03:10.960 --> 00:03:13.080
I can't...

00:03:14.290 --> 00:03:17.920
You were really cool today.

00:03:17.920 --> 00:03:19.050
Huh?

00:03:19.050 --> 00:03:22.930
We're honoured to be able to fight alongside you!

00:03:23.760 --> 00:03:26.470
I hope we get to keep working with you.

00:03:26.470 --> 00:03:27.810
Yeah.

00:03:28.810 --> 00:03:31.810
I'll... I'll try my best.

00:03:48.740 --> 00:03:51.120
Vante, hurry!

00:03:58.500 --> 00:03:59.710
Huh?

00:03:59.710 --> 00:04:00.710
Ow!

00:04:02.670 --> 00:04:04.260
Oh, sheesh!

00:04:05.590 --> 00:04:08.140
The anti-force field isn't functioning...

00:04:08.140 --> 00:04:09.890
I wonder what's wrong.

00:04:12.980 --> 00:04:15.190
You're making a lot of noise this morning.

00:04:15.190 --> 00:04:17.060
Oh, Onii-chan.

00:04:20.900 --> 00:04:23.320
Here you go. This one's for you.

00:04:31.870 --> 00:04:33.960
Wh-What is this?

00:04:35.330 --> 00:04:37.580
I was thinking we need an anti-hyper-vibration armour

00:04:37.580 --> 00:04:40.090
to stand a chance against Mirim's.

00:04:40.590 --> 00:04:42.460
But no matter how much I try,

00:04:42.460 --> 00:04:44.970
I can't get it to generate a force field.

00:04:54.690 --> 00:04:58.310
Mirim has to endure these vibrations when she's fighting?

00:04:58.310 --> 00:04:59.190
That's impressive...

00:04:59.190 --> 00:05:03.240
It puts that much more stress on your body.

00:05:03.690 --> 00:05:05.780
My theory should be sound.

00:05:06.450 --> 00:05:09.370
I wonder if the Wizard Stones aren't pure enough...

00:05:11.240 --> 00:05:13.620
All right. Let's try this one more time.

00:05:18.330 --> 00:05:20.090
You can do it, Onii-chan!

00:05:20.090 --> 00:05:22.840
Good morning, Nee-nee!

00:05:24.720 --> 00:05:26.880
Hey! Get off!

00:05:26.880 --> 00:05:29.510
What is this?!

00:05:29.510 --> 00:05:31.510
It feels so good!

00:05:32.010 --> 00:05:34.020
Hey, Lunaluna!

00:05:38.190 --> 00:05:39.940
What do <i>you</i> want?

00:05:40.650 --> 00:05:42.400
Oh, yeah.

00:05:44.610 --> 00:05:47.400
I overheard some of the villagers talking.

00:05:47.400 --> 00:05:49.280
That Mirim girl,

00:05:49.280 --> 00:05:51.780
she had armour like what you were just wearing, right?

00:05:51.780 --> 00:05:55.790
Rumours are spreading that she laid siege to a fortress not too far from here

00:05:55.790 --> 00:05:57.790
all by herself.

00:05:58.120 --> 00:05:59.370
By herself...

00:05:59.370 --> 00:06:01.750
Mirim could never do something like that!

00:06:01.750 --> 00:06:03.960
She's so kind and timid...

00:06:03.960 --> 00:06:06.630
Hey, I'm just telling you what I heard.

00:06:08.300 --> 00:06:09.550
Perhaps she's unable

00:06:09.550 --> 00:06:12.890
to control herself because of the armour.

00:06:14.220 --> 00:06:16.600
Mirim, hurry up and come over here!

00:06:22.770 --> 00:06:25.530
Well, whatever the reason, she's on the Queen's side now.

00:06:25.530 --> 00:06:26.440
She's an enemy.

00:06:26.440 --> 00:06:27.860
Let's just take them all out.

00:06:27.860 --> 00:06:29.570
This is the perfect chance.

00:06:29.570 --> 00:06:31.030
We can't do that!

00:06:31.030 --> 00:06:33.030
We can't fight against Mirim!

00:06:35.790 --> 00:06:37.250
We can't...

00:06:37.250 --> 00:06:39.620
We can't fight

00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:44.500
against Mirim...

00:07:08.280 --> 00:07:09.320
Yes...

00:07:25.090 --> 00:07:27.300
I shall make that power mine.

00:07:27.300 --> 00:07:28.880
Ymir-sama?

00:07:29.840 --> 00:07:30.800
Enter.

00:07:32.090 --> 00:07:35.140
Could you send this for me?

00:07:36.430 --> 00:07:38.310
I'll have one of my messengers deliver it.

00:07:38.890 --> 00:07:41.640
Has my mother responded yet?

00:07:42.060 --> 00:07:44.150
Seems not.

00:07:44.860 --> 00:07:45.940
I see...

00:07:46.610 --> 00:07:48.400
No need to worry.

00:07:48.400 --> 00:07:51.190
I'm sure your mother is just busy.

00:07:51.820 --> 00:07:55.280
If you do a good job, your mother's sure to be proud.

00:07:55.700 --> 00:07:57.530
I wouldn't worry too much.

00:07:58.580 --> 00:08:00.870
I will be heading back to Gainos tomorrow.

00:08:01.330 --> 00:08:03.790
You are to escort me there.

00:08:04.210 --> 00:08:06.540
I'll feel a lot better if you're there with me.

00:08:07.500 --> 00:08:08.630
I'm expecting a lot from you.

00:08:09.630 --> 00:08:11.050
R-Right!

00:08:11.760 --> 00:08:13.130
Excuse me!

00:08:33.610 --> 00:08:34.570
It's done.

00:08:34.990 --> 00:08:37.910
A camille represents strength and pride.

00:08:39.200 --> 00:08:40.870
You're the one who taught me

00:08:40.870 --> 00:08:42.410
how to make a crown of flowers.

00:08:43.000 --> 00:08:44.620
Yuit-chan!

00:08:50.170 --> 00:08:52.510
Mirim, come back home with me.

00:08:53.260 --> 00:08:56.930
I know your mom and brothers need money,

00:08:56.930 --> 00:08:58.930
but no one's going to be happy

00:08:58.930 --> 00:09:00.350
if you force yourself to fight.

00:09:01.520 --> 00:09:03.100
That's not true.

00:09:04.180 --> 00:09:06.480
Ymir-sama is happy.

00:09:07.520 --> 00:09:09.730
I don't like fighting,

00:09:09.730 --> 00:09:12.940
but Ymir said she's expecting a lot from me.

00:09:13.570 --> 00:09:17.320
Of course, I know it's this armour that's letting me do all of this.

00:09:17.320 --> 00:09:21.620
But it's the first time someone's really depending on me.

00:09:22.200 --> 00:09:25.250
It's the first time I've been needed.

00:09:27.580 --> 00:09:29.080
You're wrong!

00:09:29.080 --> 00:09:31.500
Ymir is just using you!

00:09:31.500 --> 00:09:33.340
You're being deceived!

00:09:33.340 --> 00:09:35.300
That's not true.

00:09:35.300 --> 00:09:37.430
Ymir-sama is kind.

00:09:37.430 --> 00:09:40.680
She's sending my mother my letters and money, just like she promised.

00:09:45.270 --> 00:09:48.140
And besides, I'm just taking care of

00:09:48.140 --> 00:09:50.360
the people who do bad things to the Queen.

00:09:50.360 --> 00:09:52.520
I don't really think I'm doing anything that bad.

00:09:54.530 --> 00:09:56.070
So I'm okay.

00:09:56.780 --> 00:09:57.900
Thank you.

00:09:59.360 --> 00:10:00.490
Mirim!

00:10:00.700 --> 00:10:02.120
Where are you, Mirim?

00:10:02.530 --> 00:10:04.240
Run! Hurry!

00:10:05.290 --> 00:10:05.910
But...

00:10:06.580 --> 00:10:08.540
I'm fine, so please...

00:10:08.540 --> 00:10:11.000
try to understand, Yuit-chan.

00:10:15.050 --> 00:10:16.090
Vante!

00:10:24.010 --> 00:10:25.390
Mirim-sama!

00:10:26.520 --> 00:10:29.520
The night watch said they thought they saw someone suspicious.

00:10:29.520 --> 00:10:31.020
Did you see anyone?

00:10:31.020 --> 00:10:32.610
N-No...

00:10:33.150 --> 00:10:36.070
Um, Ymir-sama.

00:10:37.400 --> 00:10:38.360
Here.

00:10:38.860 --> 00:10:39.950
What's this?

00:10:39.950 --> 00:10:42.120
I made it from some of the flowers here.

00:10:43.120 --> 00:10:45.040
I wanted to give it to you.

00:10:45.700 --> 00:10:46.700
To me?

00:10:46.700 --> 00:10:48.200
How wonderful!

00:10:48.200 --> 00:10:49.330
It's beautiful.

00:10:52.710 --> 00:10:54.040
I accept your gift.

00:10:55.250 --> 00:10:57.420
Thank you very much.

00:11:08.350 --> 00:11:09.730
Onii-chan...

00:11:11.650 --> 00:11:14.020
That's the first time I've seen Mirim like that.

00:11:14.610 --> 00:11:16.900
She looked like she was overflowing with confidence.

00:11:18.070 --> 00:11:21.200
She's gotten a lot stronger.

00:11:22.200 --> 00:11:22.910
But...

00:11:24.870 --> 00:11:28.790
I can't forgive Ymir for abusing Mirim's feelings like that!

00:11:29.500 --> 00:11:32.420
And besides, she's just relying on the armour when she fights.

00:11:32.420 --> 00:11:34.500
That's not her real strength!

00:11:36.170 --> 00:11:38.550
I want to help her...

00:11:39.210 --> 00:11:41.170
There must be a way.

00:11:42.630 --> 00:11:45.010
Perhaps we can break the armour.

00:11:47.430 --> 00:11:49.100
I'll help you out.

00:11:49.770 --> 00:11:50.770
Okay!

00:12:07.990 --> 00:12:09.450
There she is.

00:12:09.450 --> 00:12:12.250
When Nee-nee looks like she's going to be defeated,

00:12:12.250 --> 00:12:14.460
I'll swoop in and save her, and get her to thank me this time.

00:12:15.330 --> 00:12:17.290
Then Nee-nee will finally...

00:12:20.670 --> 00:12:22.420
Time to do this!

00:12:26.050 --> 00:12:28.350
It will be okay. Trust in me.

00:12:29.260 --> 00:12:31.180
Thank you, Onii-chan.

00:12:33.350 --> 00:12:35.100
She's coming!

00:13:08.140 --> 00:13:08.970
Go.

00:13:10.430 --> 00:13:11.310
Right!

00:13:17.650 --> 00:13:20.150
P-Please surrender...

00:13:20.440 --> 00:13:22.320
Yuit told me what's going on.

00:13:22.980 --> 00:13:24.490
I want to help you.

00:13:24.490 --> 00:13:25.700
Y-You can't...

00:13:25.700 --> 00:13:26.950
I'm sorry.

00:13:27.910 --> 00:13:30.070
Besides, I...

00:13:30.280 --> 00:13:32.410
I have to fight!

00:13:35.580 --> 00:13:40.790
Please run away!

00:13:42.920 --> 00:13:44.840
Such amazing strength...

00:14:01.020 --> 00:14:04.610
Please hurry up and surrender!

00:14:13.240 --> 00:14:14.330
Onii-chan!

00:14:20.710 --> 00:14:21.670
Vante!

00:14:28.800 --> 00:14:30.640
You're mine!

00:14:35.270 --> 00:14:37.230
I need to hurry up and save Nee-nee!

00:14:45.150 --> 00:14:46.860
N-Nee-sama!

00:14:53.410 --> 00:14:55.080
Thank you, Vante...

00:15:02.380 --> 00:15:03.750
Nee-sama!

00:15:05.590 --> 00:15:07.130
Sorry, Onii-chan!

00:15:07.130 --> 00:15:08.460
I got it back now!

00:15:15.220 --> 00:15:16.180
You're running away?!

00:15:19.310 --> 00:15:20.560
There must...

00:15:20.560 --> 00:15:22.730
There must be a way to destroy the armour.

00:15:28.650 --> 00:15:31.700
I wonder if the Wizard Stones aren't pure enough...

00:15:32.990 --> 00:15:34.740
I get it. The Wizard Stones!

00:15:36.370 --> 00:15:37.200
All right!

00:16:07.360 --> 00:16:10.230
I'm sorry!

00:17:02.410 --> 00:17:05.370
Nee-sama can transform like me!

00:17:06.040 --> 00:17:09.790
No... It's not that simple.

00:17:16.970 --> 00:17:18.800
She can't be...

00:17:56.720 --> 00:17:58.590
Nee-sama's so cool!

00:17:58.590 --> 00:17:59.680
So ruthless!

00:18:00.140 --> 00:18:01.850
If we don't stop her, Mirim will...

00:18:02.010 --> 00:18:02.970
Vante!

00:18:07.560 --> 00:18:09.730
Onii-chan, stop!

00:19:35.150 --> 00:19:37.400
What just happened?

00:19:38.730 --> 00:19:40.820
Onii-chan! Mirim!

00:19:41.650 --> 00:19:42.740
Ow!

00:19:47.160 --> 00:19:49.500
The tables have turned now that I have this!

00:19:49.500 --> 00:19:51.120
Hey, give that back!

00:19:52.000 --> 00:19:54.290
She has a new master now!

00:19:56.500 --> 00:19:58.250
Ymir-sama...

00:20:00.210 --> 00:20:02.380
I have no need for a failed experiment.

00:20:12.690 --> 00:20:15.730
Automaton, lay waste!

00:20:19.150 --> 00:20:20.570
Vante, no!

00:20:31.410 --> 00:20:33.460
Wh-What's going on?

00:20:34.620 --> 00:20:35.460
That's...

00:20:39.880 --> 00:20:42.050
The art of being a pirate, part three:

00:20:42.550 --> 00:20:44.470
Butt your way into every dispute,

00:20:45.050 --> 00:20:47.890
for there shall be treasure!

00:20:50.180 --> 00:20:51.430
Vante!

00:20:51.430 --> 00:20:53.980
Stop right there, you thief!

00:20:54.390 --> 00:20:56.940
This automaton is mine!

00:20:56.940 --> 00:21:01.320
I am the Iron Strategist, Ymir! I have control over the Queen's army!

00:21:01.690 --> 00:21:02.490
Put me down!

00:21:02.490 --> 00:21:04.150
Put me down this instant!

00:21:04.740 --> 00:21:06.570
If you insist.

00:21:11.490 --> 00:21:14.790
That's not what I meant!

00:21:15.920 --> 00:21:19.130
Oh, I'm very sorry about that!

00:21:19.130 --> 00:21:21.750
Farewell, everyone!

00:21:29.760 --> 00:21:31.100
Vante...

00:23:11.070 --> 00:23:14.830
My "Strongest Warrior" plan was almost complete,

00:23:14.830 --> 00:23:16.120
but thanks to Annelotte,

00:23:16.120 --> 00:23:19.540
the hyper-vibration armour I toiled over is ruined!

00:23:19.540 --> 00:23:23.330
But her strange power, that must have been...

00:23:24.460 --> 00:23:27.800
Looks like we'll need somewhat of a change in strategy.

00:23:27.800 --> 00:23:30.220
Next time: "The Flying Pirate Ship!"

00:23:30.220 --> 00:23:32.220
If Captain Liliana didn't get in the way,

00:23:32.220 --> 00:23:35.300
I would have had that automaton all to myself!
